{
  "Perk.LevelUp.StrongBack.Name": "Strong Back"
  "Perk.LevelUp.StrongBack.Desc": "You choose the 'Strong Back' perk, enabling an additional inventory slot."
  "Perk.LevelUp.StrongBack2.Name": "Strong Back 2: Strong Harder"
  "Perk.LevelUp.StrongBack2.Desc": "You choose the 'Strong Back 2: Strong Harder' perk, enabling an additional inventory slot."
  "Perk.LevelUp.ThunderousStrikes.Name": "Thunderous Strikes"
  "Perk.LevelUp.ThunderousStrikes.Desc": "You choose the 'Thunderous Strikes' perk, increasing normal damage by 20% while your strength is over 80."
  "Perk.LevelUp.HeavyImpact.Name": "Heavy Impact"
  "Perk.LevelUp.HeavyImpact.Desc": "You choose the 'Heavy Impact' perk, doubling the effectiveness of large weapons."
  "Perk.LevelUp.BrutalBlows.Name": "Brutal Blows"
  "Perk.LevelUp.BrutalBlows.Desc": "You choose the 'Brutal Blows' perk, which reduces enemy armor with each hit."
  "Perk.LevelUp.IronFists.Name": "Iron Fists"
  "Perk.LevelUp.IronFists.Desc": "You choose the 'Iron Fists' perk, hardening your fists. This increases attack power by 10 and parry chance by 3 while unarmed. Benefits are reduced for claws."
  "Perk.LevelUp.IronFists2.Name": "Iron Fists 2"
  "Perk.LevelUp.IronFists2.Desc": "You choose the 'Iron Fists 2' perk, further hardening your fists. This increases attack power by another 6, parry chance by 1, and armor penetration by 5%. Benefits are reduced for claws."
  "Perk.LevelUp.Parry.Name": "Parry"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Parry.Desc": "You choose the 'Parry' perk, giving you a chance to deflect blows with your weapon. (Speed-based)."
  "Perk.LevelUp.Berserker.Name": "Berserker"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Berserker.Desc": "You choose the 'Berserker' perk, which unlocks the 'Berserk' magical ability. Berserking increases attack and lust resistance but reduces physical defenses."
  "Perk.LevelUp.HoldWithBothHands.Name": "Hold With Both Hands"
  "Perk.LevelUp.HoldWithBothHands.Desc": "You choose the 'Hold With Both Hands' perk. As long as you're wielding a melee weapon and you're not using a shield, you gain 20% strength modifier to damage."
  "Perk.LevelUp.IronFists3.Name": "Iron Fists 3"
  "Perk.LevelUp.IronFists3.Desc": "You choose the 'Iron Fists 3' perk, even further hardening your fists. This increases attack power again by 6, parry chance by 1, and armor penetration by 5%. Benefits are reduced for claws."
  "Perk.LevelUp.ColdFury.Name": "Cold Fury"
  "Perk.LevelUp.ColdFury.Desc": "You choose the 'Cold Fury' perk, causing Berserking to only reduce your armor by half instead of completely reducing it to zero."
  "Perk.LevelUp.Opportunist.Name": "Opportunist"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Opportunist.Desc": "You choose the 'Opportunist' perk, giving you a free attack against any enemy that attempts to distance himself from you."
  "Perk.LevelUp.Tank.Name": "Tank"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Tank.Desc": "You choose the 'Tank' perk, giving you an additional 50 HP!"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Regeneration.Name": "Regeneration"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Regeneration.Desc": "You choose the 'Regeneration' perk, allowing you to heal 1% of max HP every round of combat and 2% of max HP every hour!"
  "Perk.LevelUp.ImprovedEndurance.Name": "Improved Endurance"
  "Perk.LevelUp.ImprovedEndurance.Desc": "You choose the 'Improved Endurance' perk. Thanks to your physical conditioning, your maximum fatigue has been increased by 20!"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Tank2.Name": "Tank 2"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Tank2.Desc": "You choose the 'Tank 2' perk, granting an extra maximum HP for each point of toughness."
  "Perk.LevelUp.Regeneration2.Name": "Regeneration 2"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Regeneration2.Desc": "You choose the 'Regeneration 2' perk, giving you an additional 1% of max HP per turn in combat and 2% of max HP per hour."
  "Perk.LevelUp.ImmovableObject.Name": "Immovable Object"
  "Perk.LevelUp.ImmovableObject.Desc": "You choose the 'Immovable Object' perk, granting 10% physical damage reduction."
  "Perk.LevelUp.ShieldMastery.Name": "Shield Mastery"
  "Perk.LevelUp.ShieldMastery.Desc": "You choose the 'Shield Mastery' perk, increasing block chance by up to 10% as long as you're wielding a shield (Toughness-based)."
  "Perk.LevelUp.ImprovedEndurance2.Name": "Improved Endurance 2"
  "Perk.LevelUp.ImprovedEndurance2.Desc": "You choose the 'Improved Endurance 2' perk. Thanks to your improved physical conditioning, your maximum fatigue has been further increased by 10!"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Resolute.Name": "Resolute"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Resolute.Desc": "You choose the 'Resolute' perk, granting immunity to some statuses and allowing you to ignore stuns by spending fatigue.</b>"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Juggernaut.Name": "Juggernaut"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Juggernaut.Desc": "You choose the 'Juggernaut' perk, granting extra 10 armor points when wearing heavy armor and immunity to damage from been constricted/squeezed."
  "Perk.LevelUp.IronMan.Name": "Iron Man"
  "Perk.LevelUp.IronMan.Desc": "You choose the 'Iron Man' perk, reducing the fatigue cost of physical special attacks by 50%"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Evade.Name": "Evade"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Evade.Desc": "You choose the 'Evade' perk, allowing you to avoid enemy attacks more often!"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Runner.Name": "Runner"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Runner.Desc": "You choose the 'Runner' perk, increasing your chances to escape combat and successfully move on the battlefield!"
  "Perk.LevelUp.DoubleAttack.Name": "Double Attack"
  "Perk.LevelUp.DoubleAttack.Desc": "You choose the 'Double Attack' perk. This allows you to make two attacks so long as your strength is at 60 or below. By default your effective strength will be reduced to 60 if it is too high when double attacking. <b>You can enter the perks menu at any time to toggle options as to how you will use this perk.</b>"
  "Perk.LevelUp.SpeedyRecovery.Name": "Speedy Recovery"
  "Perk.LevelUp.SpeedyRecovery.Desc": "You choose the 'Speedy Recovery' perk, boosting your fatigue recovery rate!"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Agility.Name": "Agility"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Agility.Desc": "You choose the 'Agility' perk, increasing the effectiveness of Light/Medium armors by a portion of your speed."
  "Perk.LevelUp.Unhindered.Name": "Unhindered"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Unhindered.Desc": "You choose the 'Unhindered' perk, granting chance to evade when you are wearing light clothing."
  "Perk.LevelUp.LightningStrikes.Name": "Lightning Strikes"
  "Perk.LevelUp.LightningStrikes.Desc": "You choose the 'Lightning Strikes' perk, increasing the attack damage for non-heavy weapons.</b>"
  "Perk.LevelUp.LungingAttacks.Name": "Lunging Attacks"
  "Perk.LevelUp.LungingAttacks.Desc": "You choose the 'Lunging Attacks' perk, granting 25% armor penetration for standard attacks."
  "Perk.LevelUp.Blademaster.Name": "Blademaster"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Blademaster.Desc": "You choose the 'Blademaster' perk. Your chance of critical hit is increased by 5% as long as you're wielding a bladed weapon and not using a shield."
  "Perk.LevelUp.Precision.Name": "Precision"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Precision.Desc": "You've chosen the 'Precision' perk. Thanks to your intelligence, you're now more adept at finding and striking an enemy's weak points, reducing their damage resistance from armor by 10. If your intelligence ever drops below 25 you'll no longer be smart enough to benefit from this perk."
  "Perk.LevelUp.Spellpower.Name": "Spellpower"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Spellpower.Desc": "You choose the 'Spellpower' perk. Thanks to your sizable intellect and willpower, you are able to more effectively use magic, boosting base spell effects by 50%."
  "Perk.LevelUp.Mage.Name": "Mage"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Mage.Desc": "You choose the 'Mage' perk. You are able to focus your magical abilities even more keenly, boosting your base spell effects by 50%."
  "Perk.LevelUp.Awareness.Name": "Awareness"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Awareness.Desc": "You choose the 'Awareness' perk, allowing you to see the Armor and Corruption values of an opponent."
  "Perk.LevelUp.Tactician.Name": "Tactician"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Tactician.Desc": "You choose the 'Tactician' perk, increasing critical hit chance by up to 10% (Intelligence-based)."
  "Perk.LevelUp.Medicine.Name": "Medicine"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Medicine.Desc": "You choose the 'Medicine' perk, giving you a chance to remove debilitating poisons automatically! Also, increases HP restoration on rest."
  "Perk.LevelUp.StaffChanneling.Name": "Staff Channeling"
  "Perk.LevelUp.StaffChanneling.Desc": "You choose the 'Staff Channeling' perk. Basic attack with wizard's staff is replaced with ranged magic bolt."
  "Perk.LevelUp.Archmage.Name": "Archmage"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Archmage.Desc": "You choose the 'Archmage' perk, increasing base spell strength by 50%."
  "Perk.LevelUp.FocusedMind.Name": "Focused Mind"
  "Perk.LevelUp.FocusedMind.Desc": "You choose the 'Focused Mind' perk. Black Magic is less likely to backfire and White Magic threshold is increased."
  "Perk.LevelUp.RagingInferno.Name": "Raging Inferno"
  "Perk.LevelUp.RagingInferno.Desc": "You choose the 'Raging Inferno' perk. Cumulative 20% damage increase for every subsequent fire spell without interruption."
  "Perk.LevelUp.Battlemage.Name": "Battlemage"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Battlemage.Desc": "You choose the 'Battlemage' perk. You start every battle with Might effect, as long as you meet Black Magic requirements to cast it before battle."
  "Perk.LevelUp.Spellsword.Name": "Spellsword"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Spellsword.Desc": "You choose the 'Spellsword' perk. You start every battle with the Charge Weapon effect, as long as you meet the requirements to cast it before battle."
  "Perk.LevelUp.SeverTendons.Name": "Sever Tendons"
  "Perk.LevelUp.SeverTendons.Desc": "You choose the 'Sever Tendons' perk, adding a chance for every attack to reduce your target's strength and speed permanently."
  "Perk.LevelUp.FertilityPlus.Name": "Fertility+"
  "Perk.LevelUp.FertilityPlus.Desc": "You choose the 'Fertility+' perk, making it easier to get pregnant. It also increases your cum volume by up to 50% (if appropriate)!"
  "Perk.LevelUp.ImprovedSelfControl.Name": "Improved Self-Control"
  "Perk.LevelUp.ImprovedSelfControl.Desc": "You choose the 'Improved Self-Control' perk. Thanks to your mental conditioning, your maximum lust has been increased by 20!"
  "Perk.LevelUp.ColdBlooded.Name": "Cold Blooded"
  "Perk.LevelUp.ColdBlooded.Desc": "You choose the 'Cold Blooded' perk. Thanks to increased control over your desires, your minimum lust is reduced! (Caps minimum lust at 20 below max. Won't reduce minimum lust below 20 though.)"
  "Perk.LevelUp.HotBlooded.Name": "Hot Blooded"
  "Perk.LevelUp.HotBlooded.Desc": "You choose the 'Hot Blooded' perk. As a result of your enhanced libido, your lust no longer drops below 20! (If you already have some minimum lust, it will be increased by 10)"
  "Perk.LevelUp.FertilityMinus.Name": "Fertility-"
  "Perk.LevelUp.FertilityMinus.Desc": "You choose the 'Fertility-' perk, making it harder to get pregnant. It also decreases your cum volume by up to 30% (if appropriate)!"
  "Perk.LevelUp.WellAdjusted.Name": "Well Adjusted"
  "Perk.LevelUp.WellAdjusted.Desc": "You choose the 'Well Adjusted' perk, reducing the amount of lust you naturally gain over time while in this strange land!"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Masochist.Name": "Masochist"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Masochist.Desc": "You choose the 'Masochist' perk, reducing the damage you take but raising your lust each time! This perk only functions while your libido is at or above 60!"
  "Perk.LevelUp.CorruptedLibido.Name": "Corrupted Libido"
  "Perk.LevelUp.CorruptedLibido.Desc": "You choose the 'Corrupted Libido' perk. As a result of your body's corruption, you've become a bit harder to turn on. (Lust gain reduced by 10%!)"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Seduction.Name": "Seduction"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Seduction.Desc": "You choose the 'Seduction' perk, upgrading the 'tease' attack with a more powerful damage and a higher chance of success."
  "Perk.LevelUp.Nymphomania.Name": "Nymphomania"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Nymphomania.Desc": "You've chosen the 'Nymphomania' perk. Due to the incredible amount of corruption you've been exposed to, you've begun to live in a state of minor constant arousal. Your minimum lust will be increased by as much as 30 (If you already have minimum lust, the increase is 10-15)."
  "Perk.LevelUp.Acclimation.Name": "Acclimation"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Acclimation.Desc": "You choose the 'Acclimation' perk, making your body 15% more resistant to lust."
  "Perk.LevelUp.Sadist.Name": "Sadist"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Sadist.Desc": "You choose the 'Sadist' perk, increasing damage by 20 percent but causing you to gain lust from dealing damage."
  "Perk.LevelUp.ArousingAura.Name": "Arousing Aura"
  "Perk.LevelUp.ArousingAura.Desc": "You choose the 'Arousing Aura' perk, causing you to radiate an aura of lust when your corruption is over 70."
  "Perk.LevelUp.Resistance.Name": "Resistance"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Resistance.Desc": "You choose the 'Resistance' perk, reducing the rate at which your lust increases by 10%."
  "Perk.LevelUp.Survivalist.Name": "Survivalist"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Survivalist.Desc": "You choose the 'Survivalist' perk. With this perk, your hunger rate is reduced by 20%."
  "Perk.LevelUp.FistsOfFury.Name": "Fists of Fury"
  "Perk.LevelUp.FistsOfFury.Desc": "You choose the 'Fists of Fury' perk, which unlocks combat stances to greatly enhance unarmed combat while not wielding a shield."
  "Perk.LevelUp.Survivalist2.Name": "Survivalist 2"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Survivalist2.Desc": "You choose the 'Survivalist 2' perk. With this perk, your hunger rate is reduced by another 20%."
  "Perk.LevelUp.VitalAim.Name": "Vital Aim"
  "Perk.LevelUp.VitalAim.Desc": "You choose the 'Vital Aim' perk, granting critical chance when shooting a bow."
  "Perk.LevelUp.StrongDraw.Name": "Strong Draw"
  "Perk.LevelUp.StrongDraw.Desc": "You choose the 'Strong Draw' perk, granting increased damage when firing a bow."
  "Perk.LevelUp.PracticedForm.Name": "Practiced Form"
  "Perk.LevelUp.PracticedForm.Desc": "You choose the 'Practiced Form' perk, reducing fatigue cost when firing a bow."
  "Perk.LevelUp.EagleEye.Name": "Eagle Eye"
  "Perk.LevelUp.EagleEye.Desc": "You choose the 'Eagle Eye' perk, increasing chance to hit when firing a bow."
  "Perk.LevelUp.NoBaggage.Name": "No Baggage"
  "Perk.LevelUp.NoBaggage.Desc": "You choose the 'No Baggage' perk, greatly increasing bow attack damage while unencumbered."
  "Perk.LevelUp.FanShot.Name": "Fan Shot"
  "Perk.LevelUp.FanShot.Desc": "You choose the 'Fan Shot' perk, granting the Fan Shot combat ability."
  "Perk.LevelUp.Frustration.Name": "Enraged Frustration"
  "Perk.LevelUp.Frustration.Desc": "You choose the 'Enraged Frustration' perk. Every missed attack grants the next one +10% cumulative damage. Resets when an attack lands."
}
